**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
.git
.gitignore
**/*.md
# Env files at any depth (next.config.mjs also loads apps/web/.env, and Next's standalone output
# would copy one into the image): secrets come from env_file at run time, never from the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/coverage
**/.turbo
.DS_Store
apps/web/drizzle
# Not needed by any image (Dockerfiles copy packages/shared, apps/* and deploy/web-preflight.mjs).
art
videos
docs
# Anchor workspace: ~900 MB of Rust build output and the gitignored keypairs (programs/.keys/). No
# image needs it: only the web's program.test.ts reads programs/idl, and tests never run in Docker.
programs
# Android TWA project and signing keys must never enter an image.
twa
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
